  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kamer: An Opportunity for Every Woman 2022-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kamer: En M&#xf6;jlighet f&#xf6;r Varje Kvinna 2022 - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att skapa ett samh&#xe4;lle med ett &#xf6;kande antal bemyndigade kvinnor som st&#xe5;r upp mot v&#xe5;ld som aktiva deltagare i samh&#xe4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to create a society with increasing number of empowered women standing up against violence as active participants of the society.
To achieve this objective, the project has the following outcomes:
Outcome 1  KAMER, as an effective, powerful, and qualified organization strengthened its impact on the field and political processes.
Outcome 2  Women&#x2019;s attitude towards violence and their rights has changed and they have become active participants in society (including migrant, disabled women and LGBTQI+ individuals)
Outcome 3 Women are empowered in their struggle against violence and honor crimes.
Outcome 4 Public administration, men, NGOs, and the society started to take initiative related to promoting women&#x2019;s human rights and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women are empowered in their struggle against violence and honor crimes.
 Women&apos;s attitude towards violence and their rights has changed and become active participants in society</narrative>
  </description>
